  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00639",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "不知道过了多长时间，我猛然醒了过来，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "After I do not know how long, I suddenly woke up,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00639",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "仓库里好像有人点上了昏暗的灯笼，有些许动静。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It seemed that someone had lit a dim lantern in the storeroom, and there was a faint sound of movement.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00639",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "有老鼠？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Were there mice?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00639",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "还是有小偷？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Or was there a thief?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00639",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "还是天已经亮了？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Or had day already broken?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00639",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "——我不知道到底是那种状况，胆怯的睁开眼看了看。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I did not know which it was, so I timidly opened my eyes and looked.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00639",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "原来是父亲穿着睡衣，侧身坐在我床边。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It was Father, wearing his nightclothes and sitting sideways beside my bed.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00639",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "爸爸！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Father!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00639",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "但是让我吃惊的不仅仅是父亲，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But it was not only Father who surprised me,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00639",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "而且父亲面前摆放着我的雏人偶——",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "for in front of him were my hina dolls,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00639",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "从三月三女儿节一来，再也没见过的雏人偶。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "the hina dolls I had not seen again since the Girls' Day festival on March third.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
